MANIFEST
# ...but NOT the Roku channel manifest — Roku's packaging spec requires that
# exact lowercase filename at civiccast/apps/ott-native/roku/manifest, and
# git on Windows matches gitignore patterns case-insensitively by default,
# so the Python-sdist `MANIFEST` rule above silently swallowed it (found
# while wiring up ci-ott-apps.yml, S12).
!civiccast/apps/ott-native/roku/manifest

